# Pampire Wines

* Sungold Wine: 150gp,  1d8 (or 8 during a short rest) HP restoration, gets you inebriated by 1 stage per drink unless you pass a DC12 con check- AND it counts as drinking blood for a pampire, if you get inebriated you get disadvantage on diaper checks or just fail them if you're incontinent.
* Sungold Wine: Black Sun Reserve: 500gp, 2d10 (or 20 during a short rest) HP restoration, gets you inebriated by 2 stages per drink unless you pass a DC12 con check- AND it counts as drinking blood for a pampire, if you get inebriated you get disadvantage on diaper checks or just fail them if you're incontinent.
* Mother's Eternal Heart Bloodwine: 1000gp, 3d12 (or 36 during a short rest) HP restoration, gets you inebriated by 2 stages per drink unless you pass a DC15 con check- AND it counts as drinking blood for a pampire, if you get inebriated you get disadvantage on diaper checks or just fail them if you're incontinent.